OL,3,GNEWSARhun ap Iorwerth tells Senedd he
OL,4,Ais 'deeply concerned' about cuts to BBC
OL,5,AWales
OL,6,
OL,7,FFirst Minister Rhun ap Iorwerth took
OL,8,Fquestions from opposition party leaders
OL,9,Fand Senedd members as part of his
OL,10,Fweekly scrutiny session
OL,12,FHe paid tribute to three schoolchildren
OL,13,Fhurt when their bus crashed into a
OL,14,Fbridge in Newport this morning
OL,16,FAp Iorwerth said he was "deeply
OL,17,Fconcerned" about BBC job cuts, and
OL,18,Frepeated a call for broadcasting to be
OL,19,Fdevolved to Wales
OL,23,APub: 20-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
